-round due to the Gulf Stream. The capital, Tórshavn, receives the fewest recorded hours of sunshine of any city in the world at only 840 per year.","description":"Autonomous territory of Denmark","thumbnailUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg/330px-Flag_of_the_Faroe_Islands.svg.png","canonicalUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faroe_Islands","revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-24T12:02:20Z"}},"trade":{"ok":false,"reason":"Comtrade HTTP 429 for reporter 234 flow M"},"weather":{"ok":true,"data":{"temperatureC":8.8,"windKph":18.4,"observedAt":"2026-08-02T20:45"}},"fx":{"ok":false,"reason":"No currency code for this country"},"famousPeople":{"ok":true,"data":[]},"overrides":{},"capturedAt":"2026-08-02T20:48:06.733Z"}